  {
   "bbox": [
    106.4,
    229.8,
    515.2,
    241.3
   ],
   "text": "LOSS OF LIFE FOLLOWING MAN OVERBOARD FROM P/V QUEEN OF THE WEST",
   "conf": 0.9981,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.7,
    252.9,
    89.8,
    266.4
   ],
   "text": "Ref:",
   "conf": 0.9998,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    108.4,
    253.7,
    403.9,
    266.8
   ],
   "text": "(a) Marine Safety Manual Volume V, COMDTINST M16000.10A",
   "conf": 0.9918,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    108.4,
    265.6,
    243.9,
    278.8
   ],
   "text": "(b) CG-545 Policy Letter 1-11",
   "conf": 0.9998,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    67.9,
    290.3,
    167.2,
    302.3
   ],
   "text": "Executive Summary:",
   "conf": 0.9998,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    67.5,
    314.2,
    492.5,
    326.1
   ],
   "text": "In accordance with reference (a) and (b) this Report of Investigation is prepared to document the",
   "conf": 0.9964,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.7,
    325.4,
    531.8,
    338.9
   ],
   "text": "circumstances leading to the loss of life following a man overboard from passenger vessel (P/V) QUEEN",
   "conf": 0.9928,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    67.5,
    338.1,
    329.7,
    349.6
   ],
   "text": "OF THE WEST, official number 1033572 on 07AUG2012.",
   "conf": 0.9969,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    67.5,
    362.4,
    520.7,
    374.3
   ],
   "text": "On the morning of 07AUG2012 at 0111 hrs the Coast Guard received a distress call fróm P/V QUEEN",
   "conf": 0.9905,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    67.1,
    374.7,
    532.2,
    387.5
   ],
   "text": "OF THE WEST reporting that a member of the crew had fallen overboard. The vessel was moored at the",
   "conf": 0.9957,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.3,
    386.7,
    529.8,
    400.2
   ],
   "text": "marina in Rainier, OR in position 46-05.475N 122-56.886W. The crew of P/V QUEEN OF THE WEST",
   "conf": 0.9908,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    67.5,
    400.6,
    526.7,
    412.6
   ],
   "text": "immediately launched its rescue boat and called 9-1-1 to initiate a shore-side search. A Station Portland",
   "conf": 0.9887,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.3,
    412.2,
    534.6,
    425.7
   ],
   "text": "RBS and CGR 6035 helicopter were dispatched by Sector Columbia River to assist county sheriff's office",
   "conf": 0.9914,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    67.1,
    426.1,
    507.6,
    438.0
   ],
   "text": "vessels in the search. On-scene weather conditions were 62 degrees Fahrenheit, 8 nm visibility, 0 ft",
   "conf": 0.9876,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    67.1,
    438.8,
    371.0,
    450.4
   ],
   "text": "swells, 3-4 knot currents, and 7 knot winds at 300 degrees northwest.",
   "conf": 0.9927,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.7,
    463.1,
    523.1,
    475.1
   ],
   "text": "P/V QUEEN OF THE WEST crew continued searching for an hour-and-a-half with the rescue boat and",
   "conf": 0.9958,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.7,
    476.3,
    531.4,
    489.0
   ],
   "text": "shore-side personnel with negative results. The rescue boat was recovered at 0235 hrs, half-an-hour after",
   "conf": 0.9931,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    67.1,
    489.4,
    230.0,
    501.0
   ],
   "text": "Coast Guard assets arrived on-scene.",
   "conf": 0.995,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.7,
    514.1,
    535.0,
    527.6
   ],
   "text": "At approximately 0400 hrs P/V QUEEN OF THE WEST departed from Rainier and continued her voyage",
   "conf": 0.9937,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    65.9,
    526.9,
    499.3,
    539.6
   ],
   "text": "to Stevenson, WA. Helicopter CG 6035 returned to base at 0435 hrs while the STA Portland RBS",
   "conf": 0.9958,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.3,
    540.4,
    517.5,
    552.3
   ],
   "text": "remained on-scene to conduct a first-light search. At 0835 hrs, the search was suspended and the RBS",
   "conf": 0.9987,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.7,
    553.5,
    140.6,
    564.3
   ],
   "text": "returned to base.",
   "conf": 0.9962,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.3,
    577.8,
    532.6,
    590.6
   ],
   "text": "On 12AUG2012, two civilian boaters discovered the body of the crewman floating in the Columbia River",
   "conf": 0.994,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.3,
    590.6,
    505.6,
    603.7
   ],
   "text": "channel in approximate position 46-11.35N 123-08.63W, 11 NM northwest of where the victim fell",
   "conf": 0.9851,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.7,
    603.7,
    522.7,
    615.7
   ],
   "text": "overboard. Cowlitz County Sheriff's Office deputies transferred the body to Cowlitz County Coroner's",
   "conf": 0.997,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.7,
    616.5,
    243.1,
    628.0
   ],
   "text": "Office for cause of death determination.",
   "conf": 0.9901,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    65.9,
    640.3,
    521.5,
    654.3
   ],
   "text": "On 09NOV2012, a Cowlitz County coroner indicated that the crewman died of asphyxia by drowning. ",
   "conf": 0.9907,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    65.9,
    653.1,
    532.2,
    665.8
   ],
   "text": "His death was ruled as an accident. Toxicology specimens were unattainable due to the advanced state of",
   "conf": 0.9991,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    66.3,
    665.8,
    211.3,
    677.8
   ],
   "text": "decomposition that he presented.",
   "conf": 0.9971,
   "retry": null
  }
 ]
}